[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Problem
[?2004l[?2004h> - 40% of ERROR logs from payment-svc were being dropped
[?2004l[?2004h> - They appeared in raw.log but not in errors.log
[?2004l[?2004h> - Auth-service and inventory-service ERROR logs were captured correctly
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Root Cause
[?2004l[?2004h> The `classify_line()` function in filter.py had overly broad logic to detect structured logs:
